&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s build the future of software together.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Emergent builds autonomous coding agents that replace traditional software development by generating, testing, and deploying production applications directly from plain-language intent. Our systems run in production at global scale and are used to build millions of real applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since our public launch, we’ve crossed &lt;strong&gt;$130M in Annualised Revenue&lt;/strong&gt; and grown to &lt;strong&gt;over 10M users across 190+ countries&lt;/strong&gt;, who have built &lt;strong&gt;12M+ applications&lt;/strong&gt; on Emergent. We’re backed by &lt;strong&gt;Creaegis, Khosla Ventures, SoftBank, Lightspeed, Together, Y Combinator, Google, Claypond and Sentinel Global.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re solving the hard part of AI-driven software creation: correctness, reliability, security, and scale in real production systems. The team is built by &lt;strong&gt;repeat founders, Olympiad medalists, IIT &amp;amp; IIM alumni,&lt;/strong&gt; and leaders from &lt;strong&gt;Google, Amazon, and Dropbox.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring builders who want ownership, speed, and impact at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll be the operational backbone of Emergent’s performance creative engine, and a creative contributor to it. We ship hundreds of video and static ads a month on Meta and other channels, across multiple countries. They come from a network of AI video, UGC, and translation agencies, plus in-house creators and influencers. About half your time keeps that machine running: payments, script reviews, agency follow-ups, and coordination with finance and influencer marketing. The other half is the fun part: ideating hooks, writing concepts, and running creative experiments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run Creative Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency management: be the day-to-day point of contact for our AI video, UGC, and translation agencies. Chase deliverables, track timelines, and keep the production pipeline moving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Script and asset review: check agency scripts and cuts against our brief, brand, and ad standards before they go live. Flag issues and send clear, actionable feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payments: track invoices, raise payment requests with finance, and follow up until every agency and creator is paid on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translation: coordinate localisation of winning ads into other markets and languages, and QA what comes back&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencer sourcing: work with the influencer marketing team to find, shortlist, and onboard creators who fit the brief&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trackers: keep production, payment, and creative trackers accurate, so anyone can see what’s in flight, what’s live, and what’s owed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Make Creative&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideate: brainstorm hooks, angles, and concepts for video and static ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write: draft scripts and briefs for agencies and creators, starting small and growing to full concepts you own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment: design and run creative tests, then read the results with us to work out what won and why&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay sharp: track what’s working in ads across AI, SaaS, and consumer apps, and bring fresh ideas to the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get Out of It:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll leave knowing how to run creative as a performance marketer, not just make ads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship: 1:1 time with the performance creative lead, plus feedback on your ideas, scripts, and decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The full creative process, up close: how a concept goes from brief to script to production to live ad, and what makes it win or lose&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scaling: how to run a multi-agency, multi-market creative pipeline that ships hundreds of assets a month without breaking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reading metrics as a creative: hook rate, hold rate, CTR, sign-up rate, and CAC, and how to turn those numbers into the next round of concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership: your ideas get made and tested with a real budget. You’ll see your own work in the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relentless follow-through: you close loops without being reminded, and nothing falls through the cracks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised: you’re comfortable juggling many vendors, deadlines, and payments in spreadsheets and trackers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator: you write crisp emails and messages, and can push back on an agency politely but firmly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative instinct: you watch ads and know why one works and another doesn’t, and you have opinions about it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with numbers: you’re not scared of a spreadsheet or a metrics dashboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in content, social media, ad agencies, or marketing ops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio of anything you’ve made: scripts, reels, a newsletter, side projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Meta Ads, AI video tools, or UGC workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A second language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily Meals: Lunch and Dinner provided&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Paid Time Off: Take the time you need to recharge and come back refreshed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Hours: Work arrangements that fit your life and commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let’s build the future of software together.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emergent offers a moonshot opportunity to the best talent looking to work on extraordinary outcomes. We need someone to tell this story to our employees and talent outside.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will shape how the world understands Emergent as a place to work — and you&#39;ll own it end to end. Help us our culture, EVP, values and The role is strategic and hands-on in equal measure. You&#39;ll work with the founders and leadership team to articulate and champion all components of our culture and employer brand, run a coordinated storytelling program across each stage of the talent lifecycle, while acting as the connective tissue between Marketing, Talent Acquisition, and Communications. You will help take it ‘to market’ - to our internal employees and talent market outside Emergent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work shoulder to shoulder with the founders and leadership to articulate what Emergent stands for — our values, our EVP, the things that genuinely make working here different — and then champion it everywhere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a storytelling program that runs through every stage of the talent lifecycle, from the first time someone hears our name to the day they&#39;re proudly telling a friend to join.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring the employer brand to life for our own people and for the talent market beyond Emergent — on social, in person, and in the places candidates actually spend their time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep Marketing, Talent Acquisition, and Communications pulling in one direction, so we feel like the same company whether someone meets us in a job post, a podcast, or their first week on the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draw out the moments and voices inside the company that no outsider could invent, and help employees share them with pride.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;From the strategy to the final caption, you&#39;ll set the direction and do the work — watching what lands and sharpening as you go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;9+ years in employer/talent branding and/or culture articulation and codification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a storyteller before anything else. You can take something big and abstract — a mission, a culture — and make a person feel it in a single sentence. You&#39;ve been doing some version of this for 9+ years, somewhere across employer brand, communications, content, or editorial, and you have the writing to prove it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re as comfortable with the thinking as with the doing. You can sit in a room with founders and shape the narrative, then walk out and produce it yourself. You like a blank page and a tight budget more than a big team and a rigid plan, and you reach for AI to move faster without losing the human touch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You earn trust easily — with executives, with recruiters, with the engineer who would really rather not be on camera. You pay attention to what&#39;s working and let the numbers tell you what to make next. And when priorities shift (they will), you stay steady and keep moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you&#39;ve built an employer brand from scratch, told stories to technical audiences before, worked across a global or distributed team, or actually built something on Emergent yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Advise, build and close at one of India&#39;s fastest-growing AI-native companies. Direct line to leadership, ownership&amp;nbsp;of a critical charter, and hires whose impact you will see immediately.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Emergent builds autonomous coding agents that replace traditional software development by generating, testing, and deploying production applications directly from plain-language intent. Our systems run in production at global scale and are used to build millions of real applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since our public launch, we&#39;ve crossed &lt;strong&gt;$130M in Annualised Revenue&lt;/strong&gt; and grown to &lt;strong&gt;over 10M users across 190+ countries&lt;/strong&gt;, who have built &lt;strong&gt;12M+ applications&lt;/strong&gt; on Emergent. We&#39;re backed by &lt;strong&gt;Creaegis, Khosla Ventures, SoftBank, Lightspeed, Together, Y Combinator, Google, Claypond and Sentinel Global.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re solving the hard part of AI-driven software creation: correctness, reliability, security, and scale in real production systems. The team is built by &lt;strong&gt;repeat founders, Olympiad medalists, IIT &amp;amp; IIM alumni,&lt;/strong&gt; and leaders from &lt;strong&gt;Google, Amazon, and Dropbox.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring builders who want ownership, speed, and impact at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Engineering team at Emergent builds the core systems that power our autonomous agents, platform reliability, and product velocity. We operate in an engineering-first environment with high ownership, fast feedback loops, and a strong bias toward shipping. The team works closely with Product, Research, and Design to turn ambitious ideas into production-grade systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an Engineering Manager, you will lead a high-performing team of engineers building and scaling critical platform and product capabilities. You&#39;ll balance people leadership with technical depth, ensuring your team delivers reliably while growing in skill, ownership, and impact. This role is ideal for someone who thrives in fast-moving environments, enjoys building strong teams, and wants to shape both systems and culture at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a team of software engineers through coaching, feedback, and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive high-quality, on-time delivery of product features and platform improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical execution, system design, and architectural decisions for your team&#39;s domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Design, and cross-functional stakeholders to define and execute roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong culture of ownership, code quality, and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and onboard top engineering talent as the team scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve engineering processes, tooling, and best practices to support rapid growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure teams take ownership from design through production, monitoring, and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 3 years of experience leading or managing engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong computer science fundamentals and system design skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating production systems at scale using modern backend technologies (Python, Java, Kotlin, Go, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to own projects end-to-end and deliver with high quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and a strong product mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in high-growth startups or engineering-first organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to frontend or full-stack development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on developer platforms, SaaS products, or AI-driven systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior ownership of highly available, customer-facing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead teams building at the cutting edge of AI and systems engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own high-impact systems used by millions of users globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with an exceptional team of builders and operators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, meaningful equity, and rapid career growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A rare opportunity to shape both technology and culture at massive scale&lt;/li&gt;
