&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll build Emergent’s video and programmatic channel from zero. Today our growth runs on search, social, and affiliates; YouTube, CTV, and programmatic is a new channel. You’ll be the first owner: you’ll set the strategy, pick the partners, stand up the stack, prove incrementality, and then scale it into one of our largest acquisition channels. This role works directly with growth leadership and is based in our Bengaluru office, working in-person with the team.&lt;/p&gt;
