&lt;li&gt;Run DSP vendor selection: shortlist and evaluate options (such as DV360, The Trade Desk, Amazon DSP, and specialist CTV platforms), negotiate terms, then set up accounts, audiences, brand safety, and measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and oversee managed-service partners and agencies while we build in-house capability: set goals, review their work weekly, hold them to performance and transparency standards, and plan the move in-house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run incrementality tests (geo holdouts, conversion lift and brand lift studies, matched-market tests) to prove what the channel actually adds beyond search and social&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the measurement framework for upper-funnel spend: view-through and click attribution, MMM inputs, and how video lifts brand search and direct traffic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Creative team on video built for each format (6-second bumpers, 15 to 30 second skippables, vertical Shorts, CTV spots), and turn test results into a clear creative brief&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up tracking and audiences with the data team: Google Ads and GA4 conversions, GTM, first-party audiences, and DSP pixels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report weekly on channel performance and test results, and present recommendations on scaling to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 to 6+ years in performance or growth marketing, with at least 3 years running YouTube and programmatic at scale (seven figures a month or more)&lt;/li&gt;
