&lt;li&gt;Has selected, set up, and run at least one major DSP (DV360, The Trade Desk, Amazon DSP, or similar), including contracts, fees, and inventory quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has managed agencies or managed-service partners and knows how to audit their work, fees, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
