&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will bring together Behavioral Science, Design thinking, Data, and AI to guide product decisions and shape how people work with AI agents. You will explore how users think, build trust, and make decisions when working alongside AI systems. You will partner with Product, Design, Engineering, and Marketing leaders to turn these insights into real value for our customers and build products for millions of users.&lt;/p&gt;
