&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Data &amp;amp; Insights Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; Help create tools and dashboards that combine different data sources like interview transcripts analysis, product usage to understand how human-AI interactions are evolving and what that means for our product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Across Teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the behavioral expert working closely with Product Managers, Engineers, and Designers to solve complex, open-ended product questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
