&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Science Expertise: A strong background in Behavioral Science, Cognitive Psychology, Behavioral Economics, or Human-Computer Interaction (HCI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Research Skills: Proven ability to use mixed research methods—combining deep qualitative research (like in-depth interviews and observation) with strong data analysis (like surveys, experiments, and tracking behavioral data).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Literature Review: Bring together frameworks, insights, and applications of how AI-Human interaction conversations are evolving across Industry and Academia.&lt;/li&gt;
