&lt;li&gt;Execute against joint go-to-market plans already in motion with technology partners such as AWS, Anthropic, OpenAI, MongoDB, and Stripe, turning committed activities (co-marketing campaigns, joint launch moments, credit bundles, badges, and integrations) into shipped, measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the day-to-day relationship with each partner&#39;s team, including regular business reviews and a joint scorecard tracking adoption, co-marketing reach, and retention/revenue impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functionally with product and engineering on technical integrations (APIs, partner infrastructure), with marketing on co-branded campaigns and launch events, and with finance and legal on commercial terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously evaluate our broader pipeline of complementary technology partners and bring the highest-leverage ones from early exploration to a signed, executing partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and manage commercial terms (revenue share, co-marketing investment, credits and funding) consistent with Emergent&#39;s standard partnership framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on progress, blockers, and impact across all active technology-partner motions, and build the internal tools and processes that let this function scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in partnerships, business development, or alliances with technology, platform, or infrastructure partners (payments, cloud/database infrastructure, marketplaces, or AI/ML companies).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of turning a signed plan or agreement into an operating go-to-market motion: you&#39;re as comfortable executing as you are deal-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in technical partner conversations (APIs, integrations, data infrastructure), working closely with engineering and product to get things shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong program-management skills: you can run several concurrent partner motions with hard external dates and keep every one of them moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating with a lot of ambiguity in a fast-paced startup environment where the function is still being built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and professionally persistent: you proactively find and remove internal and external barriers rather than waiting for a process to catch up with you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anchors every decision on joint customer success, not just partner count or deal volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with payments (e.g., Stripe), database/cloud infrastructure (e.g., MongoDB, AWS, GCP), marketplace, or AI/LLM ecosystem partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning and executing co-marketing campaigns and joint launch events with enterprise technology partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the AI/LLM landscape and how startups build with it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take live, high-leverage partnerships with leading technology companies from plan to measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with a Head of Partnerships who has built these motions at AWS and Stripe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how a fast-growing AI company executes and scales its technology-partner engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership, meaningful equity, and global impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Paid Time Off: take the time you need to recharge and come back refreshed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Hours: work arrangements that fit your life and commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Emergent is an equal opportunity employer. We know that strong partnerships talent comes from a wide range of backgrounds, and that candidates from underrepresented groups, including women and people of color, are statistically less likely to apply unless they meet every qualification listed above. If this role excites you and you meet most, but not all, of what we&#39;re looking for, we encourage you to apply anyway. We evaluate candidates on their skills, judgment, and record of results, not on pedigree, and not on a perfect match to a bullet list.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s build the future of software together.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Emergent builds autonomous coding agents that replace traditional software development by generating, testing, and deploying production applications directly from plain-language intent. Our systems run in production at global scale and are used to build millions of real applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since our public launch, we’ve crossed $130M in Annualised Revenue and grown to over 10M users across 190+ countries, who have built 12M+ applications on Emergent. We’re backed by Creaegis, Khosla Ventures, SoftBank, Lightspeed, Together, Y Combinator, Google, Claypond and Sentinel Global.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re solving the hard part of AI-driven software creation: correctness, reliability, security, and scale in real production systems. The team is built by repeat founders, Olympiad medalists, IIT &amp;amp; IIM alumni, and leaders from Google, Amazon, and Dropbox.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring builders who want ownership, speed, and impact at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for Performance Ad Scriptwriters to write the 30 to 60 second video ads that drive Emergent’s paid growth in Europe. Think of each script as a short screenplay. It should be complete enough that a video team, whether that’s an AI production pipeline or a human agency, can shoot it straight from the page with no back and forth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every script you write sets out the character, the setting, the dialogue, the visual beats, and the hook, all built to stop the scroll and make people act. You’ll write for European audiences, so you need to understand how they talk, what they care about, and what makes them click.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write 30 to 60 second scripts for performance video ads across Meta, YouTube, TikTok, and other paid channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build complete scripts that cover character, background and setting, dialogue, voiceover, on-screen text, and shot direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write natural, culturally accurate dialogue for US audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find and test many angles for the same product: different pain points, personas, hooks, and formats, from UGC-style and testimonial to problem-solution, demo, and skit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn product features and user insights into simple stories that convert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with AI video creators, editors, and external agencies so scripts translate well onto the screen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use performance data (hook rate, CTR, CPA, ROAS) to refine angles and keep improving winning concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put out a steady volume of fresh concepts each week to fight creative fatigue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 to 6 years of experience writing performance or direct-response ad scripts and copy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear experience writing for the Europe market: you know European tone, slang, and audience psychology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio of video ad scripts or finished ads you’ve written, for any brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong structured thinking: you can explain why a script works, not just write it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Range: you can take one product and come up with many distinct angles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write the copy yourself, end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working at speed and volume in a fast-moving startup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B2B SaaS performance marketing experience, especially across more than one SaaS brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house experience at a brand or product company (preferred over agency-only backgrounds)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI video tools and writing scripts that suit AI-generated production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UGC and creator-led ad formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
