&lt;h2 id=&quot;the-role&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own campaigns across multiple channels, work with experienced growth leaders, and gain hands-on exposure to performance marketing at a scale that most marketers take years to experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end execution and day-to-day management of performance marketing campaigns across Meta Ads, Google Ads, and TikTok Ads, for both web and app acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, launch, monitor, optimize, and scale campaigns while ensuring budgets are spent efficiently against growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute continuous A/B tests across ad creatives, copy, audiences, bidding strategies, campaign structures, and landing pages to improve conversion rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign performance daily to identify winning and losing variants, and iterate rapidly based on the data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Creative team to develop high-performing ad creatives, and provide clear, data-backed feedback on what works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct keyword, search-term, audience, and placement analysis to uncover new growth opportunities and eliminate wasted spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate conversion tracking and attribution across platforms using tools such as AppsFlyer, Google Analytics, Meta Events Manager, and Google Tag Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of platform updates, new ad formats, and emerging growth opportunities to continuously improve campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-were-looking-for&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–3 years of hands-on experience managing and optimizing Meta Ads and Google Ads campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience running campaigns in markets outside India, such as North America and Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience executing performance marketing campaigns with a strong focus on optimization and exploring new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of campaign structures, bidding strategies, audience targeting, conversion optimization, and attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running structured A/B tests and using data to identify winning creatives, landing pages, audiences, and campaign setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable analyzing campaign data, preparing performance reports, and making optimization recommendations based on metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Excel or Google Sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, analytical, and excited to work in a fast-paced startup where experimentation is part of the daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;good-to-have&quot;&gt;Good to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with TikTok Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing partners and affiliates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AppsFlyer, GA4, GTM, or similar marketing tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine curiosity and willingness to adopt new AI tools and workflows — to execute faster, automate repetitive tasks, and continuously improve marketing performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
