&lt;p&gt;Not code-completion tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Complete software systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since launching publicly, Emergent has grown to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$100M ARR in under 8 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;11 Million+ users across 190+ countries&lt;/li&gt;
