&lt;li&gt;$100M+ raised from Khosla Ventures, SoftBank, Google, Lightspeed, Prosus, Together, and Y Combinator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re now tackling the hardest problems in AI-powered software creation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How do autonomous agents reliably build production systems?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How do we verify correctness when outputs are non-deterministic?&lt;/li&gt;
