&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These aren&#39;t solved problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are no playbooks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s why we&#39;re hiring.&lt;/p&gt;
