&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work on problems at the intersection of:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliability engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program synthesis&lt;/li&gt;
