&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Emergent turns plain-language ideas into working software. We are one of the top 2 AI-native companies growing globally from India, and hiring the Sales and GTM team behind that growth is one of the most important jobs in the company. We are looking for a Talent Acquisition Lead to own it end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;A senior advisory seat, not a coordination role. You will own Sales and GTM hiring end to end - advising&amp;nbsp;leadership on the market, shaping every search, and closing the candidates who will build the revenue&amp;nbsp;organisation. You will set the bar and the strategy, not just run the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Advise Sales and GTM leadership on talent strategy: market mapping, role design and where to hunt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Own your TAM - know where Sales/GTM talent sits, what moves it, and build pipelines before you need them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Drive compensation strategy on offers: position, negotiate and close in a competitive market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Run full-cycle searches from calibration to close, holding a high bar at real pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Use AI and modern tooling thoughtfully to spend your time on judgment and candidates, not admin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in Non-Tech Talent Acquisition, with deep, proven time hiring for Sales/GTM teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve led a team — hired, managed and mentored recruiters, and owned the bar for how they work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve set up the process — built hiring systems, pipelines and playbooks from scratch, not just run someone else&#39;s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know your TAM cold — the companies, the talent pools and the market rates for Sales/GTM talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring working command of compensation strategies and can advise leaders and close candidates on offers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have thrived at a high-growth, fast-paced startup or company.&lt;/li&gt;
